Questionnaire on Quixote

Dear ,

I am Chie Takahashi, a person in charge of the Quixote systems which are
ICOT Free Software(IFS).

As you have copied one of the Quixote systems, or all of them by FTP,
I am sending you this mail to ask you to answer the following questionnaire
on Quixote.


I appreciate it if you could complete the questionaire below and send
your answers to me.

--------------------------------------------------------------------
<Questionnaire on Quixote>

1. How did you know the Quixote?

2. Why have you been interested in the Quixote?

	ex. a) I wanted to try whether I was able to make some
	       applications on the system.
	    b) As Quixote is said as one of knowledge representation
	       languages, I wanted to know what Quixote was by
	       using the system.
	    c) I wanted to look at KL1/C/KLIC sources.
	    d) Other reason


3. What did you do with the system?

	ex. a) I have compiled it.
	    b) I run the example programs in the system.
	    c) I wrote some Quixote programs and run them.
	    d) I rewrote some programs of the system in order
	       to modify it.
	    e) I made an application on the system.
	    f) Others


4. Please let me know if you have any troubles with the systems
   or requests for them.


	    a) I know some bugs.
	    b) I cannot understand the Quixote language.
	    c) I cannot use the system.
	    d) I cannot find how to write a Quixote program.
	    e) Others


5. Please let me know if you have any problems which you think
   that Quixote may solve.


6. Please let me know if you have any requests to the dissemination
   activity of the Quixote systems as IFS.


7. Please let me know if you have any comments on Quixote.

--------------------------------------------------------------------

Thank you very much for completing the questionnaire.
I am looking forward to your answers.


Yours faithfully,

Chie Takahashi

